        {
          "requestedAt": "2026-06-22T21:01:14.789Z",
          "description": "Identity note unreliable for 'create': the composed body has an explicit 'insight-flow create --title ...' example (no flags) that the agent copies verbatim, ignoring the appended --agent note. So create still binds to default + 'ready by taskmaster'. Fix: inject --by <id> directly into the create invocation in the command body, and make create bind the flow from --by when it's an entry agent. (Found in is-test N04 vue-news)",
          "requestedBy": "task-request-changes",
          "status": "implemented",
          "implementedAt": "2026-06-22T21:05:28.036Z",
          "filesChanged": [
            "packages/taskflow/src/agents/compose.ts",
            "packages/taskflow/src/agents/flow-install.ts",
            "packages/taskflow/src/cli/commands/create.ts",
            "packages/taskflow/test/agent-command.test.mjs",
            "packages/taskflow/test/default-flow.test.mjs"
          ],
          "comment": "Stamp --by <id> directly into the create invocation in the command body (the agent copies the explicit example verbatim, so the appended note was ignored for create); create now binds the flow from --by when it's an entry agent (lenient). Fixes 'ready by taskmaster' + flow-default for custom flows.",
          "implementedBy": "task-review-fix"
        }
      ],
